==Battleground==
*4 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mousse (Enemy)|Mousse]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
**1 [[Shampoo (Enemy)|Shampoo]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

